			},
			"date": "2020-02-24T15:57:19.000Z",
			"content": "I haven't tried many, but I'm currently using <a href=\"https://twitter.com/nuxt_js\">@nuxt_js</a> with Netlify CMS on mine (<a href=\"https://deltener.com\">deltener.com</a>).\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 760454,
			"parentId": 0,
