				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/d9711a9ad30ae05a761e4a728883bcbdd852cbf7d41437925b0afc47a8589795.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2020-02-24T16:03:34.000Z",
			"content": "Ah, sorry I should have added more context. A few years later I built <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\">@eleven_ty</a> <a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/\">11ty.dev</a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/JoshDeltener\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/nuxt_js\"></a>",
