			},
			"date": "2020-02-24T18:28:08.000Z",
			"content": "I recently used 11ty  and I was very surprised by its flexibility and performance. 👏\nNow I'm developing a framework on top of it, That support shopify and is 100% compatible out of the box with all shopify theme...No configuration except a token and a click on netlify deploy ✌️\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
